    <category>UltraNest.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Repository moved to https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl. Documentation is now at https://juliabayes.org/UltraNest.jl/. No changes to the package code. Merged pull requests: Update URLs after move to JuliaBayes organization (#6)…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;UltraNest v0.2.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/compare/v0.2.0...v0.2.1&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repository moved to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl&quot;&gt;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl&lt;/a&gt;. Documentation is now at &lt;a href=&quot;https://juliabayes.org/UltraNest.jl/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://juliabayes.org/UltraNest.jl/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No changes to the package code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update URLs after move to JuliaBayes organization (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6288237169&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/issues/6&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/pull/6/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/pull/6&quot;&gt;#6&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/oschulz/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/oschulz&quot;&gt;@oschulz&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align documentation code styling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6288895860&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/issues/7&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/pull/7/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/UltraNest.jl/pull/7&quot;&gt;#7&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
